{"4267630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "POOLSIDE VIGIL", "steam_appid": 4267630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>ONE STEP CLOSER TO THE TRUTH: FEBRUARY 2026</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">📢 <strong>SEE YOU AT STEAM NEXT FEST FEBRUARY 2026!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POOLSIDE VIGIL</strong> is officially joining the February 2026 Steam Next Fest! Don't miss your chance to experience the very first demo and explore these ever-shifting, unpredictable pool halls. <strong>Add to your Wishlist now</strong> and become a part of this dark journey!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/77b96a1013356c518c87b1bdc6d32f99.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/77b96a1013356c518c87b1bdc6d32f99.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/77b96a1013356c518c87b1bdc6d32f99.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>👁️ The Modern Face of Loneliness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Dev</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Digital Mirror:</strong> Its goal is not to demonize technology, but simply to show the dark void created by social media.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lonely in a Crowd:</strong> In a world of 8 billion people, why are we so isolated? Why do we only look at screens even when we are side by side?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Story:</strong> Based on a <strong>real event</strong> centered around a lack of communication and social media addiction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/13b59d5a965aa88be73769569df0d5ae.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/13b59d5a965aa88be73769569df0d5ae.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/13b59d5a965aa88be73769569df0d5ae.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 <strong>A Procedurally Generated World</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poolside Vigil's world is built from scratch every time you play. You will never experience the same nightmare twice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing Spaces:</strong> The layout of the rooms and hallways is completely random.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Enemies:</strong> You never know when and where the danger will appear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Loot:</strong> The locations of the items you need to survive change every time.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d60fc2e6790149d9e693b02fd6244505.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d60fc2e6790149d9e693b02fd6244505.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d60fc2e6790149d9e693b02fd6244505.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚖️ <strong>Choose Your Own Experience</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how you want to play the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Hide from enemies, control your asthma to avoid an attack, and loot around to keep your phone charged. A true fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Safe Mode:</strong> No mortal danger or enemies. Just focus on the story and comfortably explore the creepy liminal atmosphere.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/6d354e537bd81952aa2e4900135572a4.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/6d354e537bd81952aa2e4900135572a4.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/6d354e537bd81952aa2e4900135572a4.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌑 <strong>Watch Your Back!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no weapons, you can't fight. All you can do is run and hide.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Can Pop Up Anywhere:</strong> Enemies don't have a fixed location, they can appear suddenly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Memorizing:</strong> When you replay the game, enemies won't be in the same place. You must constantly stay alert.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/a149c94e637ac7b32f47ad1c3230929e.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/a149c94e637ac7b32f47ad1c3230929e.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/a149c94e637ac7b32f47ad1c3230929e.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💊 Watch Your Breath (Asthma)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if the enemies weren't enough, you are also fighting your own body.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the Toxic Tree:</strong> Stay away the moment you see the &quot;Smoking Kill&quot; tree, or you will run out of breath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Medicine:</strong> Collect randomly spawning loot to avoid asthma attacks and stay alive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d534a0130c32ed4f9d3448715edcb9a0.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d534a0130c32ed4f9d3448715edcb9a0.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d534a0130c32ed4f9d3448715edcb9a0.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📸 <strong>Collect Memories</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just run, you need to solve the story too.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Toy Phone:</strong> Use that plastic phone to find hidden memories around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Museum:</strong> Display every piece you find in your museum and understand what really happened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/4b94aadd80a49271ffa0ef9f91e32173.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/4b94aadd80a49271ffa0ef9f91e32173.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/4b94aadd80a49271ffa0ef9f91e32173.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔎 <strong>Discover Anomalies</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is already not normal, but some things are extra wrong.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look Closely at the Rooms:</strong> Find things that are wrong or out of place (anomalies) around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Your Eyes Open:</strong> The faster you spot the weirdness around you, the better.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/ba84dda58970e6629be53aafb3daae2f.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/ba84dda58970e6629be53aafb3daae2f.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/ba84dda58970e6629be53aafb3daae2f.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 <strong>Push, Pull, and Slide!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just running is not enough, sometimes you need to use your brain and muscles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the Items:</strong> Push, pull, and play with the physics of objects around you to clear the path or solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have Some Fun:</strong> This might be a nightmare, but when you see that water slide, don't forget to slide down and have a little fun!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/039330f85fb4919458fd61b456e8c8d7.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/039330f85fb4919458fd61b456e8c8d7.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/039330f85fb4919458fd61b456e8c8d7.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖍️ <strong>Don't Get Lost, Leave a Mark</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your own path so you don't keep going in circles in the massive maze:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Spray Paint:</strong> Leave marks with spray paint on the places you pass so you don't get lost in the maze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examine the Pictures:</strong> Don't forget to examine the story-related pictures you see on the walls to understand the story.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d2a6b9e8a6a58c74c73134dff93b8818.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d2a6b9e8a6a58c74c73134dff93b8818.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/d2a6b9e8a6a58c74c73134dff93b8818.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊<strong>Inspiration &amp; Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poolside Vigil is deeply inspired by internet phenomenons like POOLS, Liminal Spaces, Found Footage, and the Backrooms, especially the “Backrooms Pools” or “Poolrooms” concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank Jared Pike, considered one of the original artists behind the Poolrooms concept, whose work had a massive impact on the visual direction of this project, for his inspiring creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/77b96a1013356c518c87b1bdc6d32f99.poster.avif?t=1788291596\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/77b96a1013356c518c87b1bdc6d32f99.webm?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/77b96a1013356c518c87b1bdc6d32f99.mp4?t=1788291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>👁️ The Modern Face of Loneliness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Dev</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Digital Mirror:</strong> Its goal is not to demonize technology, but simply to show the dark void created by social media.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lonely in a Crowd:</strong> In a world of 8 billion people, why are we so isolated? Why do we only look at screens even when we are side by side?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Story:</strong> Based on a <strong>real event</strong> centered around a lack of communication and social media addiction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267630/extras/13b59d5a965aa88be73769569df0d5ae.poster.avif?t=1788291